  <Texts>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: <color=#FF99DD>Privileged indeed you are. Few have taken
      on the trials and succeeded before.
    TextAlignment: 260
  - <Text>k__BackingField: The sudden appearance startles me.
    TextAlignment: 257
  - <Text>k__BackingField: At the very edge of the room stands a four-poster bed,
      too large for any normal couple, the curtains pulled away to reveal the owner
      of this tower.
    TextAlignment: 257
